          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pandaŵi jelejo ŵandu ŵasagulidwe kuti aŵe acilonda ŵa ku nyumba syakusunjila yakupeleka ya ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE, yisogosi yandanda kukomala, ni ca calikumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Ŵanduwo ŵasongenye yakupelekayo pakukuya Malamusi ga Mose gakuti yeleyo ayipeleceje kwa ŵakutaga mbopesi ni kwa Alefi kutyocela ku migunda ja m'misi josope. Ŵandu wosope ŵa ku Yudako ŵaliji ŵakusengwe ni ŵakutaga mbopesi ni Alefi ŵaŵatumicilagawo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ligongo lyakuti jemanjajo ŵatendaga yiŵalamwile Mlungu mnopemnope msyungu wakuswejesya yindu ni misyungu jine. Ŵakwimba nyimbo, nambo soni alonda ŵa ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE nombe nawo ŵakamulaga masengo gawo pakukuya lilamusi lya Daudi ni lya Solomoni mwanace jwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
