              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ndaŵi jakala ja Daudi ni Asafu jwapali mlongola jwa ŵandu ŵakwimba nyimbo, soni syapali nyimbo syakumlumba ni kumtogolela Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ndaŵi ja Selubabele ni Nehemiya ŵandu ŵa mcilambo cosope ca Isalaeli ŵapelekaga mituka lisiku ni lisiku kwa ŵandu ŵakwimba nyimbo ni acilonda ŵa ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE. Ŵaŵikaga soni padela mbuwa ja Alefi, nombe nawo Alefiwo ŵaŵikaga padela mbuwa ja ŵakutaga mbopesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.47",
